#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:1
#: 7f7bd9a6d0b4472a818c2b1876f63135
msgid "Robot Asset Onboarding Checklist"
msgstr "机器人资产接入 Checklist"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:3
#: 68e823ee3e414604a1240ec109ff9ade
msgid ""
"This checklist is for an intern bringing a robot asset in for the first "
"time. Run a similar robot that is already here, and get used to what a "
"normal result looks like. Then follow this checklist to bring the new robot "
"into the existing repositories under the company conventions, and leave the "
"verified shared parts for later robots to reuse. It covers arms, mobile "
"bases, dual-arm robots, and humanoids."
msgstr "这份清单面向第一次接入机器人资产的实习生。先跑一跑现有的同类机器人，熟悉它们正常是什么样的。再按本清单把新机器人按公司规范接入现有仓库，并把经过验证的通用部件留给后续机型复用。适用于机械臂、移动底盘、双臂与人形等不同机型。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:5
#: 1c24ab236f87429fbe14fab583434b2d
msgid ""
"The work follows three chapters. Chapter 1 finishes the description package:"
" source material, meshes, Xacro assembly, and the RViz preview. Chapter 2 "
"configures ros2_control and OCS2, and signs off in Mock. Chapter 3 imports "
"the robot into Isaac Sim and closes the loop between commands and feedback. "
"Before a chapter starts on the new robot, run that chapter’s steps on a "
"similar existing robot and use the result as the reference. At the end of "
"each chapter, record the evidence and the handoff for that stage. Splitting "
"meshes and assigning colors has to be done by hand in the Blender UI. The "
"other steps can use a skill for help, and you still check them against this "
"list. The skills you can consult are at the end."
msgstr ""
"全文按工作顺序分为三章：第 1 章完成描述包的资料、网格、Xacro 装配和 RViz 预览；第 2 章配置 ros2_control 与 "
"OCS2，并做 Mock 验收；第 3 章导入 Isaac "
"Sim，并完成控制命令与反馈联调。各章开始新机型工作前，先用同类现有机型跑通本章对应步骤作为参照。各章末尾记录本阶段的验收证据和交接信息。网格拆分和上色必须亲自在"
" Blender 图形界面完成；其余环节可以使用 skill 辅助，并按本清单验收。文末列出了可参考的 skill。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:7
#: 2a46fee209c74919b3ea713e5a0e1f3f
msgid "1. Description package: configuration, split, and modularization"
msgstr "​1. 描述包：配置、拆分与模块化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:9
#: 5ea733c818e343d1a27e6bd00235fd1d
msgid ""
"This chapter finishes the description package itself: upstream material and "
"reuse, mesh cleanup, Xacro assembly, and the static display and joint "
"preview in RViz."
msgstr "本章完成描述包本身：上游资料与复用、网格整理、Xacro 装配，以及 RViz 中的静态显示和关节预览。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:11
#: 04acb192b028493aa7b0ba3a78f479a4
msgid ""
"Before starting the description package for this robot, open a robot with a "
"similar structure and purpose in RViz. Look at the whole-robot display and "
"the joint preview, and use that as the reference."
msgstr "开始本机型的描述包工作前，先用结构和用途接近的现有机器人，在 RViz 中看过整机显示和关节预览，作为参照。"

