#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:13
#: 07b3752b62b44a26b8e20b54e7d58672
msgid "1.1 Upstream material and repository roles"
msgstr "1.1 上游资料与仓库职责"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:15
#: ef4b1f8fa53e4681ab486cb03633d3d6
msgid ""
"Look at how a similar existing robot is put together, then measure the "
"parameters of this robot."
msgstr "先看同类现成机型的结构，再测量自己的机型参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:17
#: 3e2254370aaa4d37805e61f95463a253
msgid ""
"Check the local workspace, the remote development branches, and the related "
"submodules together, and decide whether a candidate model is already in the "
"tree. Looking only at the current directory misses remote assets."
msgstr "同时检查本地工作区、远程开发分支和相关子模块，确定候选模型是否已收录。只查当前目录容易漏掉远程资产。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:19
#: f128a6faa05a4c8e9969a7c6e6b6bfce
msgid ""
"Keep these apart: the vendor product page, CAD pictures that are only for "
"browsing, a downloadable model, a complete robot description package, and an"
" asset that can be simulated directly."
msgstr "区分厂家产品页面、仅供浏览的 CAD 图片、可下载模型、完整机器人描述包和可直接仿真的资产。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:21
#: 35dd5699454f4d2a9b4a03736e58f6ff
msgid ""
"From the scope of this delivery, list the parts you need, such as the base, "
"the joint chain, the end effector, and the sensors. Confirm the upstream "
"material for each one."
msgstr "根据本次交付范围列出必需部件，例如底盘、关节链、末端与传感器，逐项确认上游资料齐全。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:23
#: 083888836ec243c097959247f806406a
msgid ""
"Check the license, the upstream copyright, and the terms on third-party "
"material. Keep the attribution and license text that the terms require. An "
"existing company package is a layout reference. The license text follows the"
" actual source of the asset."
msgstr "核对许可证、上游版权和第三方素材条件。保留必要的署名及许可文本。公司已有包可参考排版，许可证内容以实际资产来源为准。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:25
#: 644607d00f6b4875bc2cb7a1f4bbc7ca
msgid ""
"Record the exact source and version of every reused part. When a part is "
"reused across models, check the mesh, the mount interface, and the license, "
"and say why it is reused in the README."
msgstr "记录每个复用件的准确来源和版本。跨型号复用时，核对网格、安装接口及许可证，并在 README 说明复用原因。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:27
#: 523fbdeebaac4638b3d6c73144610350
msgid ""
"Put the work in the right repository and branch. The description package "
"holds the Xacro, the meshes, and the controller configuration. The FaSim "
"`robots` submodule holds the robot USD. The FaSim main repository holds the "
"simulation entry points and the project configuration. Vendor upstream "
"material stays in the working copy. Delivered assets go in the matching "
"repository. A local clone can use a different folder name. Follow the role "
"of the repository and the directory convention inside the package. Category "
"and vendor directory names do not have to match between the description "
"package and the USD. Take the path from an existing asset of similar "
"structure in that repository."
msgstr ""
"确认工作放进正确仓库和分支。描述包存放 Xacro、网格和控制器配置；FaSim 的 `robots` 子模块存放机型 USD；FaSim "
"主仓库放仿真入口和工程配置；厂家上游资料放在工作副本，交付资产放到对应仓库。本地克隆后的文件夹名可能不同，以仓库用途和包内目录约定为准。描述包与 USD"
" 的类别、厂家目录也不一定同名，路径按各类仓库里结构接近的现成资产来定。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:29
#: f1b22b5bb8d445e4b44cdea8dd3d426b
msgid "1.2 Modular layout and reuse"
msgstr "1.2 模块化与复用"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:31
#: 8575d34be27d41c6bdb6be4e1ca60fc2
msgid ""
"A modular layout organizes the whole robot by how it is assembled, how it "
"moves, and what can be reused. When you divide it, look at whether a part "
"moves on its own, whether it is mounted or replaced on its own, and whether "
"another robot might reference it."
msgstr "模块化是按装配、运动和复用关系组织整机。划分时先看部件是否独立运动、是否单独安装或更换，以及是否可能被其他机型引用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:33
#: e239cf9a93e844a191339b0da6b65730
msgid ""
"In the company robot-asset repositories, each new robot can leave parts the "
"next one can use directly. Put a new part in the company-shared directory, "
"the series-shared directory, or the robot directory, according to where it "
"is used, and record the source, the coordinate frame, and the mount "
"interface. The same part can then be referenced by more than one robot, and "
"a fix has a clear place to maintain."
msgstr "对公司机器人资产仓库来说，每次接入新机型都可以积累下一次能直接使用的部件。新增部件按使用范围放入公司共享、系列共享或机型目录，并记录来源、坐标系和安装接口。这样，同一个部件可以由多款机器人引用，修正时也有明确的维护位置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:35
#: b5894a504934413cb20d535a58fb9a79
msgid ""
"Look first in the company `common` tree, in description packages of the same"
" series, and in shared FaSim USD. Record the asset path of each candidate. "
"Pay particular attention to grippers and sensors. Check the mount interface,"
" the coordinate frame, and where the part applies, then decide whether to "
"reference it as it is, reference it with a mount transform, or add a new "
"shared part."
msgstr ""
"先查公司 `common`、同系列描述包和 FaSim 共享 "
"USD，记录候选部件的资产路径。重点关注夹爪和传感器，核对安装接口、坐标系和适用范围，再决定直接引用、加安装变换后引用，还是新增共享部件。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:37
#: 48afd0d493554cebb24a01fe3d874ae4
msgid "1.3 Description package layout"
msgstr "1.3 描述包目录"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:39
#: 828b3666bedd4b22ae2ccc916badcdbc
msgid ""
"In the description repository, find a robot with a similar structure and "
"purpose and record its directory path. The FaSim robot directory is planned "
"in Chapter 3. Category and vendor names there can differ from the "
"description package. A description package follows this layout:"
msgstr ""
"在描述仓库里找一个结构和用途接近的机器人作为参考，记录其目录路径。FaSim 侧的机型目录在第 3 "
"章规划，类别和厂家命名可能与描述包不同。描述包参考结构如下："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:41
#: f9dbeafcd3b643d999c6740b63788083
msgid ""
"<category>/<vendor>/[series/]/<robot>_description/\n"
"├── CMakeLists.txt         # files and directories this package installs\n"
"├── package.xml            # ROS 2 package name and dependencies\n"
"├── README.md              # build, preview, and usage\n"
"├── xacro/\n"
"│   ├── robot.xacro        # whole-robot assembly entry\n"
"│   ├── components/        # base, arm, end effector, and other components\n"
"│   └── ros2_control/      # hardware backends and joint interfaces\n"
"├── meshes/                # meshes this package maintains, grouped by part\n"
"└── config/\n"
"    ├── ros2_control/      # controller configuration\n"
"    ├── ocs2/              # task and target configuration when OCS2 is used"
"\n"
"    └── rviz/              # RViz configuration shipped with the package"
msgstr ""
"<category>/<vendor>/[series/]/<robot>_description/\n"
"├── CMakeLists.txt         # files and directories this package installs\n"
"├── package.xml            # ROS 2 package name and dependencies\n"
"├── README.md              # build, preview, and usage\n"
"├── xacro/\n"
"│   ├── robot.xacro        # whole-robot assembly entry\n"
"│   ├── components/        # base, arm, end effector, and other components\n"
"│   └── ros2_control/      # hardware backends and joint interfaces\n"
"├── meshes/                # meshes this package maintains, grouped by part\n"
"└── config/\n"
"    ├── ros2_control/      # controller configuration\n"
"    ├── ocs2/              # task and target configuration when OCS2 is used"
"\n"
"    └── rviz/              # RViz configuration shipped with the package"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:57
#: e4cef43c998f4d80b685dab5a3eaaf78
msgid ""
"`<category>`, `<vendor>`, and `[series/]` stand for the category, the "
"vendor, and the optional series level. The top-level path follows the "
"convention of the description repository you are in. `[series/]` is optional"
" and follows that convention. Use the directories this robot and this "
"delivery need. An existing shared mesh is referenced from the assembly entry"
" or from the matching component. This robot defines the mount pose."
msgstr ""
"`<category>`、`<vendor>` 和 `[series/]` "
"分别是类别、厂家和可选的系列层级。顶层路径以所在描述仓库的惯例为准。`[series/]` "
"表示按仓库惯例设置的可选层级。各目录按机型和交付范围取用。已有的共享网格在装配入口或相应组件中引用，安装位姿由本机型定义。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:59
#: 48d1ca5226704e94a6f66e3cc24ace34
msgid "1.4 Split and reassembly"
msgstr "1.4 拆分和复装"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:61
#: 5e6ba861312045ad8027a57b868d2734
msgid ""
"The first time you bring in a description package and the meshes need "
"cleanup, you split the parts yourself in the Blender UI, and you select and "
"isolate objects or faces yourself. Export, then import again and check. The "
"other steps can use a skill for help, but you still open the model and judge"
" it, and you check it against this list. A model that already works does not"
" have to be split apart and rebuilt."
msgstr ""
"首次接入描述包、需要整理网格时，必须亲自在 Blender 图形界面完成零部件拆分，以及对象或面的选择与隔离检查，导出后再重新导入核对。其余环节可以使用"
" skill 辅助，但仍要自己打开模型判断，并按本清单验收。不必把已经可用的现成模型全部拆开重做。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:63
#: 6e4d001f55f347d4ac3bd9d5d56fb357
msgid ""
"Import the vendor’s original STL, or the other source mesh, and keep a copy "
"to compare. When a broken triangle is already in the upstream mesh, tell a "
"normal-display problem apart from missing geometry."
msgstr "先导入厂家原始 STL 或其他网格，保留一份对照。三角破面在上游就存在时，区分法线显示问题与几何缺损。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:65
#: 2afcb4cc55fe4b358bd05da5d767f159
msgid ""
"For every part, check it yourself in the Blender UI, in face select mode, "
"and separate loose parts. Use the Outliner or an isolated view, open the "
"model, and confirm the objects you split out are really there."
msgstr "每一个部件都要亲自在 Blender 图形界面，用面选择模式检查，按松散块分离。对照 Outliner 或隔离显示，打开模型确认拆出的对象真实存在。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:67
#: a9a311cf5b4e4482a52c167c19273693
msgid ""
"This is a part after it has been split into loose pieces in Blender. Several"
" named objects are selected together, and each one can be checked in the "
"Outliner."
msgstr "下面是在 Blender 中把一个部件按松散块拆开后的样子：多个具名对象同时选中，可在 Outliner 中逐项核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:69
#: 2247e7a759be49dbb813ecda7f3c834f
msgid "![A part split into loose pieces in Blender](images/blender-parts.png)"
msgstr "![在 Blender 中按松散块拆分零部件](images/blender-parts.png)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:69
#: 47dfb849341f4f41930499bd58b21084
msgid "A part split into loose pieces in Blender"
msgstr "在 Blender 中按松散块拆分零部件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:71
#: 33d298e1438748ccb6ffbed9954d28b7
msgid ""
"Keep shells, panels, light strips, wheel modules, leveling feet, and "
"anything else that has a role in the assembly. Merge small bolts, nuts, and "
"washers that have no role of their own into the component they belong to, so"
" you do not keep a pile of meaningless fragments."
msgstr "按装配含义保留外壳、面板、灯条、轮组、调平脚等。把缺少独立用途的小螺栓、螺母和垫片合进对应组件，避免大量无意义碎块。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:73
#: 3da3ab899522411d957748a7bcc069a9
msgid ""
"Name mesh objects by what the part is for, including the lower-level pieces "
"split out of it, and tidy the numbering."
msgstr "尽量按部件（以及拆分出来的下级组件）用途命名网格对象，整理编号。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:75
#: 4b8f8355847148d0a9b04285c7d500fa
msgid ""
"Export one GLB for each reusable part. One GLB can hold several named "
"objects. In the export dialog, set Format to glTF Binary (glb), and turn on "
"Limit to Selected Objects, so the file contains only the objects that are "
"selected now. Import it back into Blender and confirm the objects were not "
"fused into one."
msgstr ""
"每个可复用部件导出一个 GLB，GLB 内可以同时保留多个具名对象。导出时在对话框中把 `Format` 设为 `glTF Binary "
"(glb)`，并勾选 `Limit to Selected Objects`，只把当前选中的对象写入该文件。导出后在 Blender "
"中重新导入，确认对象没有被合成一个。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:77
#: dcdd380cb2e14462b576cb2d03e15910
msgid "This is the export dialog with Limit to Selected Objects turned on."
msgstr "下面是导出 GLB 时勾选 `Limit to Selected Objects` 的对话框示例。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:79
#: d6b5168f15d544a0b0d46c04823b7220
msgid ""
"![Export GLB with Limit to Selected Objects turned on](images/blender-"
"selected-export.png)"
msgstr "![导出 GLB 时只写入当前选中的对象](images/blender-selected-export.png)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:79
#: 241f7736114246df9fd959e1914e8601
msgid "Export GLB with Limit to Selected Objects turned on"
msgstr "导出 GLB 时只写入当前选中的对象"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:81
#: 106cb16a57324fdc910f60bc9ad00506
msgid ""
"For repeated parts on the same robot, compare geometry, material, and "
"coordinates first. Left and right arms, grippers, wheels, legs, and leveling"
" feet can be reused with a rigid transform, or with a mirror you have "
"checked. When the triangulation differs, judge by the surface deviation "
"after the parts are registered."
msgstr "同机重复件先比较几何、材质和坐标。左右臂、夹爪、车轮、腿部和调平脚等，可通过刚体变换或经验证的镜像复用。三角剖分不同可用配准后的表面偏差判断。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:83
#: 08b9febba6cd45eb96cba31d2fec134d
msgid ""
"A repeated kinematic chain can share one component macro. Use `prefix` to "
"tell the instances apart, and to tell their link and joint names apart. "
"Mirror the mesh with the `direction` parameter. Mount pose, the real inertia"
" on each side, and the limits are still given per side. After expansion, "
"check joint direction, end position, inertia, and joint axis on each side."
msgstr ""
"重复运动链可共用一套组件宏，用 `prefix` 区分各侧实例以及连杆、关节命名。网格镜像用 `direction` "
"参数处理；安装位姿、两侧实际惯量与限位仍要按侧给出。展开后逐侧核对关节方向、末端位置、惯量和关节轴。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:85
#: 17a2d3df7b8549dca889fc7b364975c2
msgid ""
"Compare wheel modules, mounts, adapter plates, leveling feet, and knobs. "
"When the fixed relationship is the same, take out one subassembly and mount "
"it again in Xacro at the real pose of each mount point. One GLB that holds "
"several named objects can be referenced the same way."
msgstr ""
"比对轮组、安装座、转接板、调平脚与旋钮。若固定关系一致，提取一份子总成，在 Xacro 中按各安装点的实际位姿复装。同一份含多个具名对象的 GLB "
"也可以这样引用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:87
#: 9ee47cd5943c4f0ca74b8def9e2be8be
msgid ""
"Use one convention for mesh coordinates, units, origin, and axes. Check XYZ "
"on the mesh after the transform, so a GLB axis conversion or a node "
"transform does not leave a part looking as if it turned 90°."
msgstr "统一网格坐标、单位、原点和轴向。用变换后的网格核对 XYZ，避免 GLB 的轴转换或节点变换让部件看起来旋转了 90°。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:89
#: 24f1ac78612e4265afdb4dc3efe79e3b
msgid ""
"When the source asset is OBJ, confirm the matching MTL and the textures came"
" with the source files. On export, keep the materials and the original split"
" normals. For a description mesh that is already aligned to ROS Z-up, use "
"`export_yup=False`. In this workflow that value is required for RViz to show"
" the mesh in the correct orientation. After export, check the orientation, "
"the size, and the sharp edges of the whole part in RViz. Remove old formats "
"from the repository only after the new asset is usable."
msgstr ""
"如果源资产是 OBJ，确认配套 MTL 和纹理随源文件齐全。导出时保留材质和原始分裂法线。对于已按 ROS Z-up 对齐的描述网格，使用 "
"`export_yup=False`：这是本流程中让 RViz 正确显示网格方向的必要配置。导出后再在 RViz "
"核对整件朝向、尺寸和锐边。确认新资产可用后再清理仓库中的旧格式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:91
#: 899161b11d3a47e19889a17276584b24
msgid ""
"When there is a steered wheel module, assign the components by the three "
"relationships: fixed, following the steer, and rolling with the wheel. Put "
"the local origin on the steer axis and on the wheel axis separately. In "
"RViz, jog the steer once and the roll once, and check the axis, the parts "
"that follow, and any mesh that shows up twice."
msgstr ""
"有转向轮组时，按固定、随转向、随车轮滚动三种关系分配组件。以转向轴和车轮轴心分别设置局部原点。在 RViz "
"各试动一次转向和滚动，核对转轴、随动部件及重复显示。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:93
#: 6c4e1caaa7464849aabd5dd1c8837ab3
msgid ""
"Compare the whole-robot assembly before and after the split. Check the "
"position, the orientation, the seams, the motion clearance, and the ground "
"height of each instance."
msgstr "对比拆分前后的整机装配，核对各实例的位置、朝向、接缝、运动间隙和落地高度。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:95
#: 54be57448bd344c9b404dc4fdc569479
msgid ""
"After the split, check model paths and what each file is for. Keep the mount"
" pose of a whole part in the component Xacro. If a leftover complete mesh is"
" still used for collision, record that reference."
msgstr "拆分后检查模型路径和文件职责。整件安装姿态在组件 Xacro 中集中管理，残留完整网格若仍用于碰撞，明确记录引用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:97
#: 271e4a49578f48fdba4c26d449936d69
msgid ""
"The meshes a description package exports at the end are GLB. Import them "
"again after export, and check orientation, size, material, and structure in "
"RViz. DAE, STL, and OBJ stay as the upstream source, or as intermediate "
"files while you convert."
msgstr ""
"描述包最终导出的网格统一使用 GLB。导出后重新导入，并在 RViz 中核对方向、尺寸、材质和结构。DAE、STL、OBJ "
"等只作为上游源或转换过程中的中间材料。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:99
#: 6ce94c15698647a0b674ddfe72f60ef9
msgid "1.5 Appearance"
msgstr "1.5 外观"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:101
#: e4f62d8ffc564bcd8cbd98cce89e8c2a
msgid ""
"The first coloring and the first material assignment are done in the Blender"
" UI. Then compare with the product photos, and look at the materials and the"
" colors yourself."
msgstr "首次上色和材质分配在 Blender 图形界面完成，再对照产品图，自己查看材质和颜色。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:103
#: 49dbfddd7cce4df598f0084f627b925c
msgid ""
"Using product photos from different angles, check the colors of the front, "
"the sides, the arms, the face, and small parts that stick out. Record color,"
" metallic, roughness, and emission."
msgstr "对照厂家不同角度的产品图，核对正面、侧面、手臂、脸部和突出小件的颜色。记录颜色、金属度、粗糙度和自发光。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:105
#: be8c8ba3c69a4e36b2e0e599cfb0c2f5
msgid ""
"Use one set of English material names. Similar dark gray, light gray, and "
"matte black can be merged. In Blender, assign materials and colors on the "
"real components, and look for stray triangles whose color stands out. After "
"a mesh update, import the GLB back into Blender and check the named child "
"objects, the material assignment, and the assembled result. If only the "
"material changed, compare the geometry and the transforms before and after."
msgstr ""
"英文材质名统一，同类深灰、浅灰和哑黑可归并。在 Blender 中按实际组件分配材质并上色，检查有没有颜色突兀的零散三角面。网格更新后在 Blender"
" 中重新导入 GLB，检查具名子对象、材质分配和装配效果。若只调整材质，再对比更新前后的几何和变换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:107
#: 84723842727b4a86aee1541087dce025
msgid ""
"For covers, trim, and other parts that cross a seam, check the surface and "
"the edges. Look for gaps, protrusions, and interpenetration on the single "
"part, at the assembled zero pose, and through the motion range of the nearby"
" joints."
msgstr "对挡板、饰盖和其他跨接缝部件检查曲面及边缘。分别在单件、装配零位和邻近关节运动范围内查看空缺、凸起与穿模。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:109
#: 289ac330fad441388b3b65d541cd5fa4
msgid "1.6 Xacro assembly"
msgstr "1.6 Xacro 装配"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:111
#: b1ae12914e2542829dd4c94d2f5d5d0c
msgid ""
"The usual conventions: angles in Xacro are written with a `PI` property. "
"When you split left and right parts, both sides share one component macro. "
"Use `prefix` to tell the instances apart, and to tell their link and joint "
"names apart. Mirror the mesh with the `direction` parameter. The values and "
"the transform follow a similar description package and the real geometry of "
"the part. Check inertia and the joint axis on each side."
msgstr ""
"常见约定：Xacro 中的角度用 `PI` 属性表达。拆分左右部件时，左右共用一套组件宏，用 `prefix` "
"区分各侧实例以及连杆、关节命名；网格的镜像用 `direction` "
"参数处理。具体取值和变换写法跟同类描述包和该部件的实际几何。两侧惯量和关节轴要逐侧核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:113
#: b6588843f40b449cb2aa8326d7448f5b
msgid ""
"Define `PI` with `xacro:property`. The limits below turn degrees into "
"radians. The numbers are only a W2 example. Another robot uses its own "
"limits."
msgstr "`PI` 用 `xacro:property` 定义。下面这些限位把角度换成弧度，其中的数值只是 W2 的示例，其他机器人应使用自己的限位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:115
#: 6d474280a381464387dd7472c0e5bf3c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<robot name=\"FiveAges W2\" xmlns:xacro=\"http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro\">\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"PI\" value=\"3.1415926535897931\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_lower\" value=\"-${PI*77.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_upper\" value=\"${PI*32.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_lower\" value=\"-${PI*152.41/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_upper\" value=\"${PI*91.96/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_lower\" value=\"-${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_upper\" value=\"${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_lower\" value=\"-${PI}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_upper\" value=\"${PI}\"/>\n"
"</robot>"
msgstr ""
"<robot name=\"FiveAges W2\" xmlns:xacro=\"http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro\">\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"PI\" value=\"3.1415926535897931\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_lower\" value=\"-${PI*77.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_upper\" value=\"${PI*32.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_lower\" value=\"-${PI*152.41/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_upper\" value=\"${PI*91.96/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_lower\" value=\"-${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_upper\" value=\"${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_lower\" value=\"-${PI}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_upper\" value=\"${PI}\"/>\n"
"</robot>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:129
#: 3d475ef42fcd4e0e99e663a3370f93fe
msgid ""
"Find a few similar description packages first. Compare the package layout, "
"the component entry, and how mesh paths are written. Then check your own "
"`CMakeLists.txt`, `package.xml`, README, and runtime dependencies. Hardware "
"backends and controller configuration are done in Chapter 2."
msgstr ""
"先找几个同类描述包，对照包目录、组件入口和网格路径写法。再核对自己的 `CMakeLists.txt`、`package.xml`、README "
"和运行时依赖。硬件后端和控制器配置在第 2 章完成。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:131
#: bfba6bb53eeb49b488cc50834d725e9e
msgid ""
"Define the modules from the assembly drawing. The whole-robot Xacro "
"instantiates them and passes the mount parameters. Left-right parts share "
"one component macro. Use `prefix` for the instance and for the link and "
"joint names, and use the `direction` parameter to mirror the mesh. Write "
"angles with the `PI` property. Check the component and the whole-robot entry"
" separately, and check the assembly, the joint direction, the end position, "
"the inertia, and the joint axis on each side."
msgstr ""
"按装配图定义模块，整机 Xacro 负责实例化并传入安装参数。左右对称件共用一套组件宏，用 `prefix` 区分实例及连杆、关节命名，网格镜像用 "
"`direction` 参数处理。角度用 `PI` 属性表达。分别验证组件和整机入口，并逐侧核对装配、关节方向、末端位置、惯量和关节轴。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:133
#: c5d382c95a49471a8b831237eac0fc37
msgid ""
"The excerpt below is one link inside the macro, not a whole robot. `prefix` "
"is built from `name`. In this part, `direction` is applied to the mesh scale"
" on Y, the center of mass on Y, the inertia products `ixy` and `iyz`, and "
"the collision position on Y. Check the visual, the center of mass, the "
"inertia, and the collision against the real geometry."
msgstr ""
"下面是宏里单个 link 的节选，不是完整机器人。`prefix` 由 `name` 生成。在这个部件里，`direction` 同时作用在网格的 Y "
"缩放、质心的 Y、惯量 `ixy` / `iyz`，以及碰撞体的 Y 位置上。外观、质心、惯量和碰撞都要按实际几何核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:135
#: bb272c2820aa4d5e8625b5ef76799983
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<xacro:macro name=\"Tron2BDachArm\" params=\"name parent direction:=1\">\n"
"    <xacro:property name=\"prefix\" value=\"${name + '_' if name else ''}\" "
"/>\n"
"    <link name=\"${prefix}proximal_pitch_Link\">\n"
"      <inertial>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0033 ${0.06714 * direction} -0.00603\" />\n"
"        <mass value=\"2.05\" />\n"
"        <inertia ixx=\"0.00389778\" ixy=\"${-0.00013725 * direction}\" "
"ixz=\"4.62e-05\"\n"
"                 iyy=\"0.00320014\" iyz=\"${5.272e-05 * direction}\" "
"izz=\"0.00357523\" />\n"
"      </inertial>\n"
"      <visual>\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </visual>\n"
"      <collision>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0006538 ${0.0608031 * direction} -0.0061907\" "
"rpy=\"1.57079632679 0 0\" />\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <cylinder radius=\"0.0678046\" length=\"0.1355752\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </collision>\n"
"    </link>\n"
"</xacro:macro>"
msgstr ""
"<xacro:macro name=\"Tron2BDachArm\" params=\"name parent direction:=1\">\n"
"    <xacro:property name=\"prefix\" value=\"${name + '_' if name else ''}\" "
"/>\n"
"    <link name=\"${prefix}proximal_pitch_Link\">\n"
"      <inertial>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0033 ${0.06714 * direction} -0.00603\" />\n"
"        <mass value=\"2.05\" />\n"
"        <inertia ixx=\"0.00389778\" ixy=\"${-0.00013725 * direction}\" "
"ixz=\"4.62e-05\"\n"
"                 iyy=\"0.00320014\" iyz=\"${5.272e-05 * direction}\" "
"izz=\"0.00357523\" />\n"
"      </inertial>\n"
"      <visual>\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </visual>\n"
"      <collision>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0006538 ${0.0608031 * direction} -0.0061907\" "
"rpy=\"1.57079632679 0 0\" />\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <cylinder radius=\"0.0678046\" length=\"0.1355752\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </collision>\n"
"    </link>\n"
"</xacro:macro>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:160
#: d92a0ecaad9940ac874abc61308ac4a6
msgid ""
"A mesh reference uses `file://$(find <package>)/<path-inside-the-package>`, "
"so later visualization tools can find the mesh. Check zero offsets, zero "
"rotations, and redundant attributes, and keep the fields that express a "
"transform you need."
msgstr ""
"引用 mesh 必须使用 `file://$(find "
"包名)/包内相对路径`，这样后续其他可视化工具才能找到网格。检查零偏移、零旋转和冗余属性，保留表达必要变换的字段。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:162
#: 34b6f7d81ae3430784524a3544b19d97
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<geometry>\n"
"  <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"</geometry>"
msgstr ""
"<geometry>\n"
"  <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"</geometry>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:168
#: 62b02549ffa14754a7bb39cd8ed75657
msgid ""
"The fragment below is the visual inside a sensor link. When `isaac` is true,"
" the `visual` is omitted and the link frame stays. When `isaac` is false, "
"ordinary visualization still has the visual."
msgstr "下面是传感器 link 内部的外观片段：`isaac` 为真时省略 `visual`，连杆坐标保留；为假时普通可视化仍保留外观。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:170
#: 240d7291b42643a78930a02da94a5496
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<xacro:unless value=\"${isaac}\">\n"
"  <visual>\n"
"    <geometry>\n"
"      <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"sensor_models)/meshes/realsense/d455.glb\" />\n"
"    </geometry>\n"
"  </visual>\n"
"</xacro:unless>"
msgstr ""
"<xacro:unless value=\"${isaac}\">\n"
"  <visual>\n"
"    <geometry>\n"
"      <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"sensor_models)/meshes/realsense/d455.glb\" />\n"
"    </geometry>\n"
"  </visual>\n"
"</xacro:unless>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:180
#: b68b3b281c2944c7aa8ff51e328a9fc5
msgid ""
"Planning and ordinary visualization usually keep the wheel modules fixed. "
"Wheel motion is enabled when the robot is imported into Isaac. "
"`wheel_joint_type` sets the joint type. `joints_movable` controls whether "
"`axis` is written. Set the two together."
msgstr ""
"规划和普通可视化通常固定轮组，导入 Isaac 时启用轮组运动。`wheel_joint_type` 设置关节类型，`joints_movable` "
"控制 `axis` 是否输出，两者配套设置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:182
#: b6c79e49fa464bed980b427c583f904c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<joint name=\"fr_wheel_joint\" type=\"${wheel_joint_type}\">\n"
"  <origin xyz=\"-0.00071653 -0.003566 -0.136\"/>\n"
"  <parent link=\"fr_steer\"/>\n"
"  <child link=\"fr_wheel\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:if value=\"${joints_movable}\">\n"
"    <axis xyz=\"0 1 0\"/>\n"
"  </xacro:if>\n"
"</joint>"
msgstr ""
"<joint name=\"fr_wheel_joint\" type=\"${wheel_joint_type}\">\n"
"  <origin xyz=\"-0.00071653 -0.003566 -0.136\"/>\n"
"  <parent link=\"fr_steer\"/>\n"
"  <child link=\"fr_wheel\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:if value=\"${joints_movable}\">\n"
"    <axis xyz=\"0 1 0\"/>\n"
"  </xacro:if>\n"
"</joint>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:193
#: 9903a2390dad45c4b37da1bb75537a44
msgid ""
"When there is an upstream URDF, expand the whole-robot Xacro with the "
"equivalent options and compare it with the upstream file: joint type, parent"
" and child links, mount pose, axis, limits, mass, inertia, and mesh "
"references. Record each intentional change and why it was made."
msgstr "有上游 URDF 时，用等效选项展开整机 Xacro，与上游对比关节类型、父子连杆、安装位姿、转轴、限位、质量、惯量和网格引用。记录有意改动及原因。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:195
#: 0512be976647440f98f8b18e48b7cc76
msgid ""
"Confirm the end-effector frame (TCP) sits at the useful position on the "
"gripper. In RViz, check that frame against the gripper geometry. The "
"interactive target and the target marker are checked in Chapter 2."
msgstr "确认末端参考系（TCP）在夹爪有效位置。在 RViz 中核对该坐标系与夹爪几何的相对位置。交互目标与目标框的检查在第 2 章进行。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:197
#: 7330d59281ba4d298f7f153840f71f02
msgid ""
"Check the left and right grippers separately: the driving joint, the "
"follower joint, the open and close direction, and the normalized position. "
"Compare the driven angle with the real opening."
msgstr "分别检查左、右夹爪的主动关节、随动关节、开合方向和归一化位置。对照驱动角度与实际开口。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:199
#: 1fc6bd31112344a6bb9f2916a7aee072
msgid ""
"When a motion direction needs a smaller range, first confirm the positive "
"and negative joint directions and the lower and upper limits in the "
"description package. The same limit can be applied in more than one layer. "
"Check it against the real limits of this robot. The limits used by planning,"
" control, and simulation are checked in Chapter 2 and Chapter 3."
msgstr ""
"如需缩小某个运动方向的范围，先在描述包中确认关节正负方向和上下限。相同的限位需求可能做在不同层，按本机型的实际限位核对。规划、控制和仿真各自使用的限位，分别在第"
" 2 章和第 3 章核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:201
#: cffb0ad6686c4491b1b3fa305c9c3a4e
msgid "1.7 Static display and joint preview in RViz"
msgstr "1.7 RViz 静态与关节预览"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:203
#: 7eaa1ed27bb54b6f9e9ed9404e54621e
msgid ""
"Open the whole robot in RViz first. Confirm `Fixed Frame`, the RobotModel "
"status, `robot_description`, `joint_states`, and TF. When a moving part such"
" as an arm is missing, tell a missing TF apart from a mesh that failed to "
"load."
msgstr ""
"先用 RViz 查看整机，确认 `Fixed Frame`、RobotModel "
"状态、`robot_description`、`joint_states` 和 TF。缺少手臂等可动部分时，区分 TF 缺失和网格读取失败。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:205
#: 08e5f7df5b644dd2a35929945dc85ab2
msgid "1.8 Sign-off and handoff"
msgstr "1.8 验收与交接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:207
#: 052d5694ebf34b8ba6237133c71a3084
msgid ""
"When meshes are cleaned up for the first time, the sign-off should be able "
"to say that the split check and the color setup were done in the Blender UI,"
" and that the export was checked by importing it again."
msgstr "首次整理网格时，验收应能说明已在 Blender 图形界面完成拆分检查和上色配置，并用重新导入的结果核对导出是否正确。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:209
#: 4da26ba9cd3247b081d2c1b5d670b5c5
msgid ""
"From the installed package, expand the default whole robot, the variants you"
" deliver, and each component entry. Use `check_urdf` to confirm the URDF "
"parses and the joint tree is valid. Also check that each mesh path in the "
"expanded result resolves to a file."
msgstr ""
"从安装后的包分别展开默认整机、交付的变体和各组件入口。用 `check_urdf` 验证 URDF "
"能解析且关节树有效，另逐一核对展开结果中的网格路径能否解析到文件。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:211
#: ee92bdcf6414483d806844f40b78d076
msgid ""
"Write the README the way similar robots do. Cover the build, the "
"visualization, the component preview entry, and the parts, sensors, and "
"upstream variants that were actually reused. Use a generic example "
"workspace, paths relative to the repository, and the shortest commands, and "
"check that the links and the commands match the current code."
msgstr ""
"README "
"参考同类机器人，写清构建、可视化、组件预览入口，以及实际复用的部件、传感器和上游变体。用通用示例工作空间、仓库相对路径和最简命令，并核对其中的链接和命令与当前代码一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:213
#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:279
#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:344
#: 00e1142240944a65b393c053cba7e519 4f64aa0944fe4692ba55bf8052d7710c
#: 6bb9483130cb47399b17464b1b4a17de
msgid ""
"The handoff note names the repositories, branches, commits, and evidence "
"that were actually pushed at this stage. List, on their own, the items that "
"were not pushed, still need a real measurement, or still need to be merged."
msgstr "交接记录写清本阶段实际推送的仓库、分支、commit 和验证证据。未推送、待实测或待合入的项目单列。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:215
#: adddc58b0f3c417b9394c140b1eb7198
msgid ""
"After the description package is signed off, pose the whole robot in viser, "
"frame the view, and take the screenshot for the robot portrait. Doubao can "
"remove the background, and GIMP can clean a watermark. On the finished "
"image, check that the robot outline, the small parts, and the material "
"colors stay clear and are not distorted. Keep the original screenshot to "
"compare against, and deliver it with the rest of this stage."
msgstr ""
"描述包验收完成后，在 viser 中摆好整机姿态与视角，截图制作机器人定妆照。可用豆包去除背景，再用 GIMP "
"清理水印。成图要核对机器人轮廓、细小部件和材质颜色保持清楚、不失真。建议保留原始截图供对照，并随本阶段成果一起交付。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:217
#: bd0bd6498e0a45629cac802a0f85ab5a
msgid "2. Configure ros2_control and OCS2"
msgstr "​2. 配置 ros2_control 与 OCS2"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:219
#: 4689bb1100044792962858a8fb65f858
msgid ""
"This chapter configures the control interfaces, keeps the runtime model and "
"the planning model apart, checks `task.info` against the startup log, and "
"signs off under Mock. When you use OCS2 whole-body control, `ocs2-wbc-"
"controller` can be installed from a deb. You do not need access to the "
"private source repository."
msgstr ""
"本章配置控制接口，区分运行模型和规划模型，按启动日志核对 `task.info`，并在 Mock 下验收。使用 OCS2 全身控制时，`ocs2"
"-wbc-controller` 可用 deb 安装，不必申请私有源码仓库权限。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:221
#: d99a9ba6666f4619b9d7f8b6e8bc94f5
msgid ""
"Before configuring control for this robot, run Mock control on a similar "
"existing robot. Look at a normal state change and at command feedback, and "
"use that as the reference."
msgstr "开始本机型的控制配置前，先用同类现有机器人跑通 Mock 控制，看过正常的状态切换和指令反馈，作为参照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:223
#: b7e34bdc4d1345d6b9552b896762ee23
msgid "2.1 Control interfaces and models"
msgstr "2.1 控制接口与模型"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:225
#: 86450c529b2b472995895bab476f5f1e
msgid ""
"`interfaces` is where the modular control interfaces are imported. "
"`robot.xacro` in the `ros2_control` directory is where the import of the "
"whole hardware system is organized."
msgstr ""
"`interfaces` 用于导入模块化的控制接口；`ros2_control` 文件夹里面的 `robot.xacro` 用来组织整个 "
"`hardware system` 的导入。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:227
#: ba4f67fe93bf47ff8f6d6322fdc673c3
msgid ""
"Compare the hardware backends and the controller groups that similar "
"description packages support, and finish the ros2_control interfaces and the"
" controller configuration for this robot. Import the modular control "
"interfaces in `interfaces`. Organize the import of the whole hardware system"
" in `ros2_control/robot.xacro`."
msgstr ""
"对照同类描述包支持的硬件后端和控制器分组，完成本机型的 ros2_control 接口与控制器配置。在 `interfaces` "
"中导入模块化的控制接口，在 `ros2_control/robot.xacro` 中组织整个 `hardware system` 的导入。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:229
#: fb4d01cbbd114aff9217f7c136396817
msgid "2.2 URDF for OCS2 motion control"
msgstr "2.2 针对 OCS2 运控用 URDF 的处理"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:231
#: 30f3fd6d51f84df7868b8d8d712a442f
msgid ""
"The planning model is what OCS2 uses. It can differ from the runtime model. "
"The items below are how that planning URDF is handled."
msgstr "规划模型供 OCS2 使用，可以和运行模型不同。下面处理规划用 URDF。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:233
#: 255ccab40be941ee8432a551609a4985
msgid ""
"Expand the runtime model and the planning model with the launch parameters "
"you actually use. Check the active joints, the joints locked during "
"planning, and the joints a separate controller owns. Confirm the end-"
"effector frames and the collision geometry that planning needs are still "
"there, and check the limits that planning and control actually use."
msgstr "按实际启动参数分别展开运行模型和规划模型，核对活动关节、规划中锁定的关节及独立控制器负责的关节。确认规划所需的末端参考系和碰撞几何仍存在，并核对规划和控制实际使用的限位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:235
#: c90d8f77ea684f3fa9455034c754ccc8
msgid ""
"In the planning model, fix or disable joints that OCS2 does not plan, such "
"as the gripper and the dexterous hand, and keep the TCP and the collision "
"geometry that planning needs. The runtime model can keep the active joints "
"and the follower joints, with a separate controller owning them. The switch "
"that fixes those joints follows the configuration of this robot."
msgstr ""
"在规划模型里固定或关闭夹爪、灵巧手等不由 OCS2 规划的关节，并保留规划所需的 TCP "
"和碰撞几何。运行模型可以保留主动和随动关节，由独立控制器负责。固定开关参数按本机型实际配置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:237
#: e289a2e9580749cabc07241819ccc8b4
msgid ""
"For joints that easily fall into an unwanted pose or a local optimum, the "
"range can be tightened in the planning URDF that OCS2 uses. Record the "
"joint, the old range, the new range, and the reason, and keep that record "
"apart from the real hardware limits. Leave the runtime URDF and the "
"mechanical limits unchanged."
msgstr ""
"对容易落入不期望构型或局部最优的部分关节，可以在 OCS2 使用的规划 URDF "
"里适当收紧范围。记录调整的关节、原来的范围、新的范围和原因，并与实际硬件限位区分开。运行 URDF 和机械限位保持不变。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:239
#: d4b10d83c76345b79161a241095a5ddb
msgid ""
"Sign off in Mock with HOME and a few representative targets. The motion "
"stays inside the planning range, and the motions you need are still covered."
" Then compare the planning model with the related entries in `task.info` and"
" confirm they agree."
msgstr ""
"用 HOME 和若干代表性目标在 Mock 中验收：规划范围无越界，所需动作仍能覆盖。再对照规划模型和 `task.info` "
"里的相关配置，确认前后一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:241
#: fe5d7eda6e514acd9cf464dc80ed5233
msgid ""
"When you fill in `task.info`, follow the joint order printed in the OCS2 "
"startup log, and check the initial state, the limits, and the other entries "
"one by one. The joint order declared in the URDF can differ from the order "
"after Pinocchio imports the model."
msgstr ""
"配置 `task.info` 时，按 OCS2 启动日志输出的关节顺序，逐项核对初始状态、限位等配置。注意：URDF 中的关节声明顺序可能与 "
"Pinocchio 导入后的顺序不同。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:243
#: edd7a0b6e81a466f860ed29e046a7d8e
msgid "2.3 Mock sign-off"
msgstr "2.3 Mock 验收"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:245
#: bb9c04f0abc6439492326e6751535456
msgid ""
"Test the real states one by one: HOLD, HOME, MOVEJ, and OCS2. Record which "
"modes can drag a target or control joints, and keep a single publish apart "
"from a continuous publish. After you enter a target mode you can interact "
"with, use the RViz target marker to check the end-effector target against "
"the real gripper position."
msgstr ""
"按 HOLD、HOME、MOVEJ、OCS2 的实际状态逐项测试。记录哪些模式支持拖目标或关节控制，区分单次发布和连续发布。进入可交互的目标模式后，用 "
"RViz 目标框核对末端目标与夹爪实际位置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:247
#: 0cc52fe724e64a3b8493b644f59b5dab
msgid "2.4 Sign-off for more than one control mode"
msgstr "2.4 多控制模式验收"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:249
#: 418a5ea876274013945d7cf0ed90886c
msgid ""
"When this robot is delivered with more than one control mode, sign each mode"
" off on its own."
msgstr "本机型交付多种控制模式时，分别验收。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:251
#: b7ebc6d1f48b427e9bb06191acc6757f
msgid ""
"Start each control mode you deliver. Check the controllers that are actually"
" active, how the joints are divided, and the target frame. Arm, head, and "
"gripper controllers can divide the work differently from one mode to "
"another. Send a small command and check that the command and the feedback "
"match. When the mode has a coupled behavior such as automatic gaze, check "
"the coupled target and the real response together."
msgstr "分别启动交付的各控制模式，核对实际激活的控制器、关节分工和目标坐标系。手臂、头部和夹爪的控制器分工可能随模式不同。用小幅指令检查命令与反馈是否对应，支持自动注视等联动时同时检查联动目标和实际响应。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:253
#: 1ab672b744c3436288cf1307116d17e8
msgid "2.5 Planning collision"
msgstr "2.5 规划碰撞"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:255
#: 89403df6c13140e6b72377206b3eebd4
msgid ""
"This section checks the collision geometry used for planning, and the OCS2 "
"collision pairs, which are used for distance queries while planning. "
"Physical contact inside Isaac Sim is checked in Chapter 3."
msgstr "本节检查规划用碰撞几何和 OCS2 碰撞对，用于规划中的距离计算。Isaac Sim 里的物理接触在第 3 章检查。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:257
#: 4863f31615f64ada909454b1f0e3c4c3
msgid ""
"In RViz, show the visual geometry and the collision geometry at the same "
"time. Look in particular for a long uncovered stretch between the shoulder "
"and the elbow, on the elbow cover, at the wrist seam, and on the column."
msgstr "在 RViz 同时对照显示几何与碰撞几何。重点检查肩肘之间的长壳、肘盖、腕部接缝和立柱有没有大段漏覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:259
#: 1746a663ecbb43ab8637a106b99e63b9
msgid ""
"Check the geometry type, the length, the radius, the direction, and the link"
" the shape is attached to. A transverse cylinder on the elbow cover and a "
"longitudinal cylinder on the upper arm, for example, cover different "
"regions."
msgstr "检查几何类型、长度、半径、方向和挂载连杆。比如横向肘盖圆柱与纵向大臂圆柱分别覆盖不同区域。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:261
#: 9bad9294020e436b81cbbf8191b5f4e1
msgid ""
"Check which link pairs OCS2 actually enables. A collision body that RViz can"
" draw takes part in that distance query only when its link is in a "
"configured pair. After a rename, check that each collision pair still "
"resolves, compare the configuration before and after, and confirm which "
"names moved and what was really added or removed. Check each affected region"
" again with a normal motion and with a motion that comes close to "
"interference, and watch the distance and the controller response."
msgstr ""
"检查 OCS2 实际启用了哪些连杆对。RViz "
"能画出的碰撞体，只有其连杆出现在配置对里才会参与对应距离计算。改名后检查各碰撞对能否解析，并对比前后配置，确认名称迁移和实际增删。受影响区域分别用正常动作和接近干涉的动作复验，观察距离和控制器响应。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:263
#: 0870929456f24d32afd7e4066b0fdeb3
msgid "2.6 Solve behavior and steady-state jitter"
msgstr "2.6 求解与稳态抖动"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:265
#: 4a30731dc90745708d1e3f56f8662b66
msgid ""
"Do this section when the solve misbehaves, the steady state jitters, or the "
"MPC needs a change. A first integration does not start by tuning every "
"parameter."
msgstr "出现求解异常、稳态抖动或需要调整 MPC 时再做本节。首次接入不必默认调完所有参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:267
#: 6c6e228c475b417fb36cedcdd545e2d4
msgid ""
"With the target held fixed, record the target pose, the current pose, the "
"joint feedback, and the MPC time when it is available, at the same time. A "
"small move on the RViz error panel has to be read against the joint data."
msgstr "固定目标后同步采集目标位姿、当前位姿、关节反馈与可用的 MPC 耗时。RViz 误差面板小幅变化需要与关节数据对照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:269
#: bf5c0c2ef7eb4d7fba13caece7b569e2
msgid ""
"Under Mock, check the log for the FSM switching back and forth, for a "
"collision trigger, for a solver error, or for a timing warning."
msgstr "在 Mock 下检查日志中的 FSM 反复切换、碰撞触发、求解报错或定时告警。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:271
#: e0674049a2fa4cc79ddb684d956a04c8
msgid ""
"Change one variable at a time, with the same HOME, the same target, and the "
"same observation window. Record the time to arrive and the steady-state end "
"error. Use the largest single-step joint change, the peak-to-peak value, and"
" the net drift to tell high-frequency jitter apart from a slow drift of the "
"pose. After the single-step change gets smaller, the joints can still drift "
"slowly while the end target stays fixed."
msgstr ""
"用同一 "
"HOME、同一目标和同一观测窗口做单变量对照。记录到位时间和稳态末端误差，并用最大单步关节变化、峰峰值和净漂移区分高频微抖与缓慢构型漂移。单步变化变小以后，关节仍可能在固定末端目标下缓慢漂移。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:273
#: afb940bfbc67431895b2b6935c92ab59
msgid ""
"Compare `inputCost.R.arm.scaling`, the per-joint velocity weights, the "
"running and terminal end-effector weights, the MPC rate, and how far ahead "
"the policy sample is taken. Confirm the value that actually takes effect, "
"and its unit."
msgstr "对照 `inputCost.R.arm.scaling`、逐关节速度权重、末端运行与终端权重、MPC 频率和策略取样提前量。确认参数的实际生效值和单位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:275
#: 742b0994852d447b917ebef3fc3240e5
msgid "2.7 Sign-off and handoff"
msgstr "2.7 验收与交接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:277
#: 896917add0c646df821b63eeaa626cdd
msgid ""
"Check that the Mock control entry, the collision-pair count, the links, and "
"the commands in the README match the current code."
msgstr "核对 README 中的 Mock 控制入口、碰撞对数量、链接和命令与当前代码一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:281
#: 967b01862e8746cca1a631bf84692b2c
msgid "3. Import into Isaac Sim and close the loop"
msgstr "​3. 导入 Isaac Sim 并联调"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:283
#: 03f623e8bfff441683d1bce34d6bd023
msgid ""
"This chapter imports the robot into FaSim / Isaac Sim, organizes the USD "
"layers, checks physics and sensors, and closes the loop between control "
"commands and feedback."
msgstr "本章把机型导入 FaSim / Isaac Sim，组织 USD 层，检查物理和传感器，并完成控制命令与反馈闭环。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:285
#: 55f1e60c618a40299ff746052a20c08c
msgid ""
"Before simulation bring-up for this robot, run the Isaac startup and the "
"bring-up on a similar existing robot. Look at normal simulation and control "
"feedback, and use that as the reference."
msgstr "开始本机型的仿真联调前，先用同类现有机器人跑通 Isaac 的启动和联调，看过正常的仿真和控制反馈，作为参照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:287
#: 853ba873efda4bbda0e2a2680d06b23c
msgid "3.1 Directories, layers, and startup"
msgstr "3.1 目录、层与启动"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:289
#: 0015e0df19504424a7ec681ff62ebdf2
msgid ""
"In the FaSim `robots` submodule, find a robot with a similar structure and "
"purpose and record its directory path. The layout looks like this:"
msgstr "在 FaSim 的 `robots` 子模块里，找一个结构和用途接近的机器人作为参考，记录其目录路径。参考结构如下："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:291
#: 0f4093a6f2d94310b9f94ece33257268
msgid ""
"robots/<category>/<vendor>/[series/]/<Robot>/\n"
"├── <Robot>.usda           # whole-robot asset entry; composes the robot "
"layers\n"
"├── payloads/              # parts, geometry, materials, physics, sensors, "
"and the ROS layers\n"
"├── env/                   # empty scene or demo scene that references the "
"robot, including the ground\n"
"├── Textures/              # textures or material assets this robot needs to"
" ship with the asset\n"
"└── README.md              # entry and usage, when similar robots follow "
"this convention"
msgstr ""
"robots/<category>/<vendor>/[series/]/<Robot>/\n"
"├── <Robot>.usda           # whole-robot asset entry; composes the robot "
"layers\n"
"├── payloads/              # parts, geometry, materials, physics, sensors, "
"and the ROS layers\n"
"├── env/                   # empty scene or demo scene that references the "
"robot, including the ground\n"
"├── Textures/              # textures or material assets this robot needs to"
" ship with the asset\n"
"└── README.md              # entry and usage, when similar robots follow "
"this convention"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:300
#: a44cc1d5b9f5419b8b9eb147e39f1552
msgid ""
"`robots` is a submodule of the FaSim workspace. The top-level path follows "
"that workspace. `[series/]` is optional. Category and vendor names can "
"differ from the description package. Follow a similar robot in this "
"submodule. `<category>`, `<vendor>`, and `[series/]` stand for the category,"
" the vendor, and the optional series level. An existing shared USD is "
"referenced from the whole-robot entry or from the matching component layer. "
"This robot defines the mount pose. Use the directories this robot and this "
"delivery need."
msgstr ""
"`robots` 是 FaSim 工作区中的子模块。顶层路径以该工作区惯例为准。`[series/]` "
"为可选层级。类别和厂家命名可能与描述包不同，按该子模块里的同类机型来。`<category>`、`<vendor>` 和 `[series/]` "
"分别是类别、厂家和可选的系列层级。已有的共享 USD 在整机入口或相应组件层引用，安装位姿由本机型定义。各目录按机型和交付范围取用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:302
#: 35c0c27b3114422c86ca8d09c1bfa3fb
msgid ""
"Start from the entry points in the FaSim README. Keep the ordinary empty "
"scene, the grasp scene, and the other backends apart, and confirm a second "
"Isaac process was not started by accident."
msgstr "按 FaSim README 的入口启动。区分普通空场景、抓取场景和其他后端，确认没有意外启动第二个 Isaac 进程。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:304
#: ade3b5a9da16438a8c6113c746c09407
msgid ""
"Confirm the FaSim assets land in this robot’s directory under the `robots` "
"submodule. Organize the whole-robot entry, geometry, parts, physics, "
"materials, sensors, and ROS as separate layers. Left and right parts can "
"each have their own assembly nodes in the same layer."
msgstr ""
"确认 FaSim 资产落在 `robots` 子模块对应机型目录。把整机入口、几何、部件、物理、材质、传感器和 ROS "
"分层组织，左右部件可在同一层里配置各自装配节点。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:306
#: aa82a770eda64e529d784d0e0096487c
msgid ""
"Check every local relative reference in the USD, the `defaultPrim` of each "
"layer, the robot root prim, the variants, the joint paths, and the "
"ActionGraph targets. Open the empty scene and the grasp scene separately."
msgstr ""
"核对 USD 每个本地相对引用、层的 `defaultPrim`、机器人根 Prim、变体、关节路径和 ActionGraph "
"目标。空场景与抓取场景分别打开。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:308
#: 40bad4d79e3e46bcb09fb00c03a85cb8
msgid ""
"After a GLB is converted to USD, check materials, material subsets, "
"emission, instanced mirrors, and origins. Before an old visual mesh is "
"removed, check whether a collision asset, such as a gripper, still "
"references the old path."
msgstr "GLB 转 USD 后检查材质、材质子集、发光、实例镜像和原点。回收旧显示几何前先查是否仍有夹爪等碰撞资产引用原路径。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:310
#: dc1dab9666f645439c08db0865343431
msgid ""
"Keep the job of `geometries.usd` apart from the job of the material layer. "
"If visual geometry moves, confirm every part reference moves with it, and "
"that the physics and material bindings still resolve after the layers are "
"composed."
msgstr "区分 `geometries.usd` 与材质层的职责。若迁移显示几何，确认所有部件引用随之更新，物理和材质绑定在合成后仍能解析。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:312
#: 580545791c3a4e47b6405617bacd5500
msgid "3.2 Physical contact"
msgstr "3.2 物理接触"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:314
#: ec49b506ef2f4f7583451e2863690c80
msgid ""
"This section checks settling on the ground, support, and contact in Isaac "
"Sim. That is simulation physics. The physics collision meshes used by "
"simulation are handled in the USD simulation assets."
msgstr "本节检查 Isaac Sim 中的落地、支撑和接触，属于仿真物理。仿真用的物理碰撞网格放在 USD 仿真资产中处理。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:316
#: 3759faa8e880419aa71f987068bf9bc6
msgid ""
"Put a ground and a physics scene in the empty scene. After the simulation "
"starts, check the ground height, how the robot is fixed, whether the support"
" is stable, and whether collision penetrates, and check the limits the "
"simulation actually uses."
msgstr "空场景放置地面和物理场景。开始仿真后检查落地高度、固定方式、支撑稳定性和碰撞穿透，并核对仿真实际使用的限位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:318
#: 9ac3b382b6ac46ff800cc1f16171ecff
msgid ""
"When the base is unstable, compare the wheel collision shape, the ground "
"collision shape, the initial position, and the contact settings separately. "
"On a retest, keep the initial pose and the contact parameters fixed, and "
"change only the wheels or only the ground. One combination falling over only"
" says that combination has a problem. Changing one item at a time is what "
"shows which change made the support more stable."
msgstr "底座不稳时分别对照轮碰撞形状、地面碰撞形状、初始位置及接触设置。复测时固定初始位姿与接触参数，分别只改轮或只改地面。某一组合失稳，只能说明这套搭配有问题，单项对照才能判断哪项改动改善了稳定性。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:320
#: e172b35284d543ef9383bfd8e7123ec8
msgid "3.3 Command and feedback loop"
msgstr "3.3 控制命令与反馈闭环"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:322
#: 8b73df0780324a64871546972214e7a2
msgid ""
"After you press Play, check that the ROS bridge has started, that a trial "
"command drives the robot in Isaac, and that RViz receives joint states from "
"the simulation. Check the simulation clock. Motion in RViz on its own only "
"says the current control chain responds. Check which hardware backend is in "
"use as well."
msgstr ""
"点 Play 后检查 ROS Bridge 已启动，确认试发指令能驱动 Isaac 机器人，且 RViz "
"接收到来自仿真的关节状态。核对仿真时钟。RViz 自己能动只说明当前控制链有响应，需另核对所用硬件后端。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:324
#: 6ea5c79918304dab81834d4e47d5871a
msgid ""
"Record the ROS description package and the USD version that were signed off "
"together. After a joint name, a frame, or a command interface changes, "
"compare the Xacro, the controller configuration, the bridge mapping, and the"
" USD layer by layer, and confirm the interfaces and the mapping match on "
"both sides. After both sides are on the latest commit, still check the "
"mapping and the joint names."
msgstr ""
"记录配对验收的 ROS 描述包和 USD 版本。关节名、参考系或指令接口变动后，逐层对照 Xacro、控制器配置、桥接映射和 "
"USD，确认两边的接口及映射一致。两边都更新到最新提交后，仍要核对映射和关节名。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:326
#: 87863386d0c344c9951ff2bca828bcec
msgid ""
"Compare gripper feedback in RViz and in Isaac at open, closed, and partial "
"opening. When the gripper needs to open and close gradually, check the "
"interpolation, the speed limit, and how the control interface runs that "
"motion. When `adaptive_gripper_controller` is used, check that the "
"controller stops after the force goes over the limit."
msgstr ""
"对比 RViz 和 Isaac 中夹爪开启、闭合和部分开度的反馈。需要渐进开合时，检查插值、速度限制及控制接口的执行方式。使用 "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller` 时，检查力超过上限后控制器会停机。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:328
#: a8751dd8895e49a189fe3ba4439fe49a
msgid "3.4 Sensors"
msgstr "3.4 传感器"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:330
#: 48e537a2bd80472c9e77f21b1e5632b9
msgid ""
"Confirm the sensor model and the shared asset. When a visual asset is "
"standing in for another, record that substitution, and check the geometry, "
"the optical frame, and the simulated output separately."
msgstr "核实传感器型号与共享资产。外观资产代用时记录替代关系，并分别验证几何、光学坐标和模拟输出。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:332
#: 5111b2e88f8142188ce863c1540f1d53
msgid ""
"On its own, look at the lens direction of the sensor mesh after it is "
"brought in from the shared asset. Then look at the real pose with the whole-"
"robot assembly script. Check whether the head shell or the torso blocks the "
"lens."
msgstr "独立查看从共享资源接入后传感器网格的镜头朝向，再用整机装配脚本查看实际位姿。检查镜头是否被头壳或躯干遮挡。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:334
#: 901070cc76ec4ccebb1c7dc5c79ff765
msgid ""
"Keep the shell mount transform, the optical frame, and the simulation Camera"
" prim apart. When the shell is translated to line the assembly up, check "
"whether the optical pose should stay where it is. For a camera on the "
"underside, also check the view direction and the demo parameters."
msgstr "区分外壳安装变换、光学坐标和仿真 `Camera Prim`。平移外壳做装配对齐时，核实光学位姿是否需要保持。底部相机另核对取景方向及演示参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:336
#: bb83f1b5cfd3493fae96fb58931f3ac7
msgid ""
"Check the parent, the origin, and the axes of the camera optical frame in "
"the whole-robot TF, and compare them with the real pose of the Camera prim "
"in Isaac. The ROS optical frame points +Z forward, +X to the right of the "
"image, and +Y down the image. The USD camera’s local frame points −Z forward"
" and +Y up. Convert with the convention that belongs to each one."
msgstr ""
"核对相机光学坐标系在整机 TF 中的父节点、原点和轴向，并与 Isaac 中 `Camera Prim` 的实际位姿对照。ROS 光学系为 +Z "
"朝前、+X 朝画面右、+Y 朝画面下。USD Camera 局部 −Z 朝前、+Y 朝上。按各自约定换算。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:338
#: fb36b03177b44826b77dd0cd0aae05a3
msgid ""
"After the conversion, switch to each camera and look at the real image. A "
"marker can be placed along the expected view direction, to check the "
"direction, which way is up in the image, and the field of view. When the "
"camera is mounted on a moving link, jog that joint and confirm the camera "
"follows. If a ROS image is published, also check that the message "
"`header.frame_id` resolves to the matching optical frame."
msgstr ""
"换算后，切换到每台相机查看实际画面。可在预期取景方向放置标记，核对方向、画面上下和视场。相机装在运动连杆上时，试动关节确认相机随动。若发布 ROS "
"图像，再核对消息的 `header.frame_id` 能解析到对应光学系。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:340
#: 521ab95647544f65a900fd572b27a65c
msgid "3.5 Sign-off and handoff"
msgstr "3.5 验收与交接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:342
#: 52da2423be924e148c42c68926aa47e6
msgid ""
"Add the Isaac bring-up entry and the scene names to the README, and check "
"that the links and the commands match the current code. Use a generic "
"example workspace, paths relative to the repository, and the shortest "
"commands."
msgstr "README 补全 Isaac 联动入口和场景名称，并核对其中的链接、命令与当前代码一致。用通用示例工作空间、仓库相对路径和最简命令。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:346
#: 6e44c1cb899c49cea8fe57fe62e5f547
msgid "3.6 Skills you can consult"
msgstr "3.6 可参考的 skill"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/11-robot_asset_checklist.md:348
#: 8549903cf3534a2e90ff6c5ad2c16e83
msgid ""
"These skills are there to consult and to help. Splitting meshes and "
"assigning colors has to be done by hand in Blender. The other steps can use "
"these skills, and you still check them against this list. The notes are "
"under `.cursor/skills/` in the company description repository. Open "
"`SKILL.md` in the matching directory."
msgstr ""
"这些 skill 可供参考和辅助。网格拆分和上色必须亲自在 Blender 中完成；其余环节可以使用它们，并按本清单验收。说明写在公司描述仓库的 "
"`.cursor/skills/` 下，打开对应目录的 `SKILL.md`。"

